           r'\(n(e^-) = 500 / 96\,500 = 5.18 \times 10^{-3}\ \text{mol}\); \(n(\text{Cu}) = \tfrac{1}{2} n(e^-) = 2.59 \times 10^{-3}\ \text{mol}\)',
